{
  "id": "move",
  "label": "Reschedule",
  "hint": "Drag an appointment to another person.",
  "anchor": "drag-create",
  "initial": {
    "view": "preferred",
    "theme": "light",
    "density": 6,
    "zoom": 1.3,
    "controls": []
  },
  "steps": [
    {
      "action": "find",
      "target": "[data-event-id=\"2026-10-19-event-0\"]"
    },
    {
      "action": "wait",
      "ms": 900
    },
    {
      "action": "move-event",
      "reference": "[data-event-id=\"2026-10-19-event-0\"]",
      "grid": "[data-slot=\"calendar-cell\"][data-date=\"2026-10-19\"][data-calendar-id=\"person-1\"]",
      "viewport": ".quno-calendar-viewport",
      "timeOffset": 30
    },
    {
      "action": "hover",
      "target": "[data-event-id=\"2026-10-19-event-0\"]"
    },
    {
      "action": "wait",
      "ms": 1500
    }
  ],
  "paragraphs": [
    "Plans change. Pick up an appointment and move it to another time or person, with a preview showing where it will land.",
    "Watch the pointer hold, drag, and release the card. The saved appointment follows its new position in the schedule."
  ]
}
